和 `SHA256SUMS.txt`。证据 ZIP 含当前源码快照、构建与隔离测试日志、两套清单及独立核验报告。\r\n\r\n本地通过：PR #57 两组回归、合成调度/进程等待、真实载荷隔离文件维护、完整文件 SHA-256/大小/集合、45 个 PE 架构、产品身份、Rime 固定依赖、YimeCore 干净源码及语流绑定、三模式索引二次生成一致性、系统注册/默认输入法保护检查。PS5 包校验直接调用 `Read-Package`，没有运行 Setup。\r\n\r\n本轮仅交付，不请求测试机安装、卸载、产品进程重启、默认输入法或用户数据变更。新包未做真实安装、输入或重启验收，历史包结果不转用于本包。45 个 PE 文件均未签名；这是开发测试预发布，不代表生产发布就绪。目标为 x64 Windows 及 WOW64 应用，不是 ARM64 安装包。\r\n\r\n后续范围以交付分支的 [installer/simple/HANDOFF.md](https://github.com/tsaanghwang/Yime/blob/codex/pr57-dual-product-delivery/installer/simple/HANDOFF.md) 为准；历史维护步骤不是本轮执行指令。\r\n\r\n交付提交 `c178f9cf9cab90922fd552081a761d3092138f6b` 的 [CI 35079492080](https://github.com/tsaanghwang/Yime/actions/runs/35079492080) 已成功；随后公开本预发布。发布后固定下载地址、tag 目标与原附件摘要见 `release-publication.json`。\r\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tsaanghwang/Yime/releases/388476769","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tsaanghwang/Yime/releases/388476769/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/tsaanghwang/Yime/releases/388476769/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/tsaanghwang/Yime/releases/tag/test-simple-source-a4fa6f76","id":388476769,"author":{"login":"tsaanghwang","id":207723120,"node_id":"U_kgDODGGacA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/207723120?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsaanghwang","html_url":"https://github.com/tsaanghwang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsaanghwang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsaanghwang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsaanghwang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsaanghwang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsaanghwang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsaanghwang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsaanghwang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsaanghwang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.git