875273b42404e8d1e6a29206216a329aca44e6b01499a0e749170ae3021d`\n\n下载 ZIP 并完整解压到本机目录，运行 `Install-Uninstall.cmd`。GitHub 自动生成的 Source code 压缩包不是安装包。详细测试指令以开发分支 `installer/simple/HANDOFF.md` 为准，报告通过测试分支返回。\n\n本包是此前完成开发机验收的原始 ZIP，未重打包。包内 `BUILD-PROVENANCE.json` 记录构包当时基于 `58e360a5` 的工作区及源码快照哈希；其中验收和 CI 的 pending 是构包时状态，后续结果见上述提交中的开发验收报告。本轮提交包含构建入口和导出清单修正，两套应用均从源码构建，未使用旧安装副本作为构建输入。\n\n已知维护注意事项：开发机第一次 YimeCore 注册返回 `0x800700B7`，稍后重试成功。可能涉及卸载后注册状态尚未释放，具体原因未证实；若遇到同类冲突，保存工作并正常重启，再运行同一完整包。不要删除无关注册项。原始失败证据随验收记录保留，不宣称首次尝试成功。\n\n本次测试只确认新源码包安装、两套输入及重启，不重复历史恢复矩阵。\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tsaanghwang/Yime/releases/362861630","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tsaanghwang/Yime/releases/362861630/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/tsaanghwang/Yime/releases/362861630/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/tsaanghwang/Yime/releases/tag/test-1.4.0-dev-58b3fd7d","id":362861630,"author":{"login":"tsaanghwang","id":207723120,"node_id":"U_kgDODGGacA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/207723120?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsaanghwang","html_url":"https://github.com/tsaanghwang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsaanghwang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsaanghwang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsaanghwang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsaanghwang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsaanghwang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsaanghwang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsaanghwang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsaanghwang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsaanghwang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOTOw_ac4VoNQ-","tag_name":"test-1.4.0-dev-58b3fd7d","target_commitish":"58b3fd7d60cead36